00:18:58,882 --> 00:19:04,333
a figure of speech. I read it literally. I
believe the United States has technology

202
00:19:04,373 --> 00:19:08,699
that manipulates time and space, and I
name no one as responsible.

203
00:19:14,389 --> 00:19:20,420
A test needs a question. Ours is old. Do
people do good for nothing, or only when

204
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:26,567
it pays? I believe we will be shown that
this intelligence has been here, watching

205
00:19:26,607 --> 00:19:32,789
