I believe the proof will be indisputable.

206
00:19:32,829 --> 00:19:34,589
I cannot show it myself.

207
00:19:37,279 --> 00:19:43,404
It has to be fair. Human judgment is
biased. A fair test needs a judge who sees

208
00:19:43,444 --> 00:19:46,839
