rumor.

209
00:19:49,529 --> 00:19:54,355
Why it is hidden. If it could be seen
coming, it would measure nothing. A test

210
00:19:54,395 --> 00:19:59,408
that announces itself shows how people
perform, not who they are. So whoever runs

211
00:19:59,448 --> 00:20:04,274
it has to stand far enough back to be
refused. And overwhelming proof produces

212
00:20:04,314 --> 00:20:09,390
fear, not trust. You get obedience, not
choice. Belief that can be chosen can’t be

213
00:20:09,430 --> 00:20:14,194
forced. And people would perform for the
test. You could argue that what I am

214
00:20:14,234 --> 00:20:19,060
revealing would once have counted as
catastrophic disclosure, because it would

215
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:24,301
have had a large impact on the test if it
were widely believed. But at this point in

216
00:20:24,341 --> 00:20:28,980
the test, near the end, it serves as a
signal and a mildly interesting data

217
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:29,728
point.

218
00:20:32,419 --> 00:20:37,986
What the files show. Since May 8, 2026 the
Department of War has published seven

