255
00:23:44,889 --> 00:23:50,675
On the scope where none were expected.
January 18, 1957. A B-52 crew on a night

256
00:23:50,715 --> 00:23:56,576
mission over the Middle East picked up a
return on the gunnery scope for five to

257
00:23:56,616 --> 00:24:02,256
