259
00:24:08,339 --> 00:24:13,783
What they told each other in 1963. A memo
from May 29, 1963 is about recovering

260
00:24:13,823 --> 00:24:19,407
fragments from space. It does not say what
the fragments are. It does say, in one

261
00:24:19,447 --> 00:24:24,891
official’s summary of another, that a
White House statement “would scare people

262
00:24:24,931 --> 00:24:30,445
needlessly.” I believe that fear is part
of why this stayed quiet for so long. I

263
00:24:30,485 --> 00:24:32,458
hope that reason has expired.

264
00:24:35,149 --> 00:24:40,394
An offer in September 1963. On September
20, 1963, President Kennedy asked the

265
00:24:40,434 --> 00:24:45,950
United Nations, “Why, therefore, should
man’s first flight to the moon be a matter

266
00:24:45,990 --> 00:24:51,642
of national competition?” He proposed that
the United States and the Soviet Union go

267
00:24:51,682 --> 00:24:56,385
